flowchart TD
    A[User enters pet name, species, and care topic] --> B[Streamlit Interface: app.py]

    B --> C{Input validation and guardrails}

    C -->|Missing pet name| D[Display warning]
    C -->|Unsupported species| D
    C -->|Valid input| E[RAG Assistant: rag_assistant.py]

    E --> F[Retriever: retrieval.py]
    F --> G[(Pet-Care Knowledge Base: pet_care_knowledge.json)]
    G --> F

    F --> H{Matching topic and pet type found?}

    H -->|No| I[Return no-guidance message]
    H -->|Yes| J[Return guidance and confidence score]

    J --> K[Generate personalized recommendation]
    K --> L[Add veterinary safety disclaimer]
    L --> M[Display recommendation in Streamlit]

    E --> N[(Application Log: pawpal.log)]
    F --> N
    K --> N

    O[Automated Tests: pytest] --> P[Check scheduling and reliability]
    P --> E
    P --> F

    M --> Q[Human reviews the recommendation]
    Q --> R{Is the result useful and appropriate?}

    R -->|Yes| S[Use the recommendation]
    R -->|No| T[Change input or consult a veterinarian]